# Kundalini Spines
#
# Take every file exactly as it is on disk. `* -text` disables git's automatic
# line-ending conversion entirely.
#
# This is deliberate. The project is authored on Windows and deployed to a Linux
# runner, and the default `text=auto` would rewrite line endings on checkout —
# which shows up as a working tree that reports itself modified the moment it is
# cloned, and as spurious whole-file diffs on every platform change. Nothing here
# needs conversion: HTML/CSS/JS/JSON are served byte-for-byte, and the assets are
# binary.
* -text

# Belt and braces for the binaries, so git never tries to diff or merge them.
*.webp  binary
*.mp4   binary
*.webm  binary
*.mp3   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.png   binary
*.ico   binary
